# Bold figures

Every number shown in the interface is bold. This includes amounts, prices, quantities, percentages, index levels, and gains.

- Use IBM Plex Mono (`var(--f-mono)`), `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`, and `font-weight: 600`.
- Do not leave a new figure at 400 or 500.
- Labels, names, and buttons stay at their own weight. Only the number is bold.
- Colour a gain or loss with `.up` or `.down`. The weight stays 600.

```css
.example-value {
  font-family: var(--f-mono);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
```
